奇数，则输出可能小于0"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：若n、m均为偶数，则输出可能小于 0"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：若n为奇数、m为偶数，则输出可能小于0"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：若n为偶数、m为奇敎.则输出可能小于0"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"单选题（完善程序）","stem":[{"t":"完善程序（1）"},{"t":"1-5题   组合题"},{"t":"（分数背包）小S有n块蛋糕，编号从1到n第i块蛋糕的价值是wi， 体积是vi。他有一个大小为B的盒子来装这些蛋糕，也就是说装入盒子的 蛋糕的体积总和不能超过B。"},{"t":"他打算选择一些蛋糕装入盒子，他希望盒子里装的蛋糕的价值之和尽量 大。"},{"t":"为了使盒子里的蛋糕价值之和更大，他可以任意切割蛋糕。具体来说，他 可以选择一个a （0<a<l）,并将一块价值是w，体枳为v的蛋糕切割成两 块.其中一块的价值是a・w,体枳是a・v,另一块的价值是（l-a）・w.体 积是（l-a）v。他可以重复无限次切割操作。"},{"t":"现要求编程输出最大可能的价值，以分数的形式输出。"},{"t":"比如n=3, B=8，三块蛋糕的价值分别是4、4、2,体枳分别是5、3、2。 那么最优的方案就是将休积为5的蛋糕切成两份，一份体积是3,价值是 2.4,另一份体积是2,价值是1.6,然后把休积是3的那部分和后两块蛋 糕打包进盒子。最优的价值之和是8.4,故程序输出42/5。"},{"t":"输入的数据范围为：1≤n≤1000,1≤B≤10^5;1≤wi,vi≤100。"},{"t":"提示：将所有的蛋糕按照性价比wi/vi从大到小排序后进行贪心选择。"},{"t":"试补全程序。"},{"t":"#include <cstdio>\r\n\r\nusing namespace std;\r\n\r\n\r\nconst int maxn = 1005;\r\n\r\n\r\nint n，B， w[maxn]， v[maxn];\r\n\r\n\r\nint gcd(int u, int v) {\r\n\r\nif(v == 0)\r\n\r\nreturn u;\r\n\r\nreturn gcd(v， u % v);\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nvoid print(int w, int v) {\r\n\r\nint d = gcd(w> v);\r\n\r\nw = w / d;\r\n\r\nv = v / d;\r\n\r\nif(v == 1)\r\n\r\nprintf(”％d\\n”， w);\r\n\r\nelse\r\n\r\nprintf(”％d/%d\\n”, w, v);\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nvoid swap(int &x, int &y) { \r\n\r\nint t = x; x = y; y = t;\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nint main() {\r\n\r\nscanf(\"％d %d\", &n， &B);\r\n\r\nfor(int i = 1; i <= n; i ++) { \r\n\r\nscanf(”％d%d，&w[i]， &v[i]);\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n for(int i = 1; i < n; i ++)\r\n\r\nfor(int j = 1; j < n; j ++)\r\n\r\nif(①){ \r\n\r\nswap(w[j], w[j + 1])； \r\n\r\nswap(v[j]，v[j + 1])；\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\nint curV, curW;\r\n\r\nif（②） {\r\n\r\n③\r\n\r\n} else {\r\n\r\nprint(B * w[1], v[1]); \r\n\r\nreturn 0;\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nfor(int i = 2; i <= n; i ++) \r\n\r\nif(curV + v[i] <= B) { \r\n\r\ncurV += v[i]; \r\n\r\ncurW += w[i];\r\n\r\n} else {\r\n\r\nprint(④)； \r\n\r\nreturn 0;\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\nprint (⑤)；\r\n\r\nreturn 0;\r\n\r\n}"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：W[j] / v[j] < w[j+1]/v[j+1]"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：W[j] / v[j]> w[j+1]/v[j+1]"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：v[j] * w[j+1]< v[j+1]*w[j]"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：w[j] * v[j+1]< w[j+1]*v[j]"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题（完善程序）","stem":[{"t":"②处应填（）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：w[1] <= B"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：v[1] <= B"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：w[1] >= B"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：v[1] >= B"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题（完善程序）","stem":[{"t":"③处应填()"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：print(v[1]w[1]); return 0;"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：curV = 0; curW = 0;"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：print(w[1] v[1]); return 0;"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：curV = v[1]; curW = w[1];"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题（完善程序）","stem":[{"t":"④处应填（）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：curW * v[i] + curV * w[i], v[i]"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：(curW - w[i]) * v[i] + (B - curV) * w[i], v[i]"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：curW + v[i], w[i]"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：curW * v[i] * (B - curV) * w[i], v[i]"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题（完善程序）","stem":[{"t":"⑤处应填（）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：curW, curV"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：curW，1"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：curV, curW"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：curV，1"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题（完善程序）","stem":[{"t":"完善程序（2）"},{"t":"6-10题   组合题"},{"t":"（最优子序列）取m=6，给出长度为n的整数序列a"},{"t":"1"},{"t":",a"},{"t":"2"},{"t":"，……a"},{"t":"n"},{"t":"（0 ≤ a"},{"t":"i"},{"t":"<2"},{"t":"m"},{"t":"）。对于一个二进制数x,定义其分值w(x)为x + popcnt(x),其中 popcnt(x)表示x二进制表示中1的个数。对于一个子序列b"},{"t":"1"},{"t":"，b"},{"t":"2"},{"t":"，…，b"},{"t":"k"},{"t":"，定 义其子序列分值S为w（b"},{"t":"1"},{"t":"㊉b"},{"t":"2"},{"t":"）+w（b"},{"t":"2"},{"t":"㊉b"},{"t":"3"},{"t":"）+w